# No *tracking state* to ignore, by design.
#
# The tracking skills keep all local state outside every git repo on the machine:
#   ~/.claude/.tracking/<org>/     the tracking clone
#   ~/.claude/<org>.status.json    session cursor
#   ~/.claude/<org>.snapshot.json  report cursor
#
# Product repos get nothing, so none of it shows up in `git status` here.
# If you find yourself adding a state directory under .claude/, read
# docs/target-workflow.md §2 first — it's deliberately not where state lives.

# OS cruft, which is not state and has no business here either. (msa1624/skills#38)
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
